# Xcode / SwiftPM build artifacts. The .xcodeproj is XcodeGen-generated, NOT
# committed — `xcodegen generate` is a required first step after cloning (see
# companion-ios/CLAUDE.md). Committing it baked personal machine state
# (DEVELOPMENT_TEAM signing) into shared history and risked silently drifting
# from project.yml with nothing to catch it.
*.xcodeproj/

## Build output
build/
DerivedData/
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Xcode per-user state (would live inside a generated .xcodeproj)
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## SwiftPM
.build/
Packages/*/.build/
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
.swiftpm/xcode/xcuserdata/

## Misc
.DS_Store
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
